<Field Name="listing_description" Value="Rivière&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Enjoy amazing river view, in the heart of Singapore River&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;District 3 – Jiak Kim Street&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The Rivière is a new blockbuster integrated development by Frasers Property Singapore.  With a strong heritage identity, this development comprises of 2 residential towers totalling 455 units, 80 units of Serviced Apartments and 3 existing conservation warehouses and shall be restored and integrated within the development.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Located on the former Zouk site, it is prominently located within the heart of Robertson Quay zone along Singapore River Promenade.  Rivière is only a few minutes’ walk away from Havelock MRT station, providing residences with accessibility to the various shopping amenities nearby. The development is also a short walk away from the upcoming Great World City MRT Station.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The Rivière will form part of a highly attractive cluster of waterfront developments, F&amp;B and lifestyle outlets.  Residents will be able to enjoy music, and nightlife just a few minutes’ walk away at Clarke Quay.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The well-planned layouts and size allocations would place Rivière as a top investment choice in the mind of investors looking for good quantum entry accompanied by strong rental demand in this privileged location. With a range of 1 to 4 bedroom types, this development caters to a variety of buyers with different budget and needs.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Project Highlights:&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Highly Sought After Former Zouk Site&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Developed by Renowned Developer - Frasers Property Singapore.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Designed by Award Winning Architect: SCDA Architect.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Within walking distance to 2 MRT stations&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Surrounded by F&amp;B and lifestyle outlets and easy access to Orchard Shopping Belt and Central Business District&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Well-planned layouts &amp; size allocations&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Call 90220678 Now To Enquire." />
